#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, marbleRecenterOnLocationChange)
#: rc.cpp:54
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The map center will be moved to a contact that has changed its location "
#| "when this setting is enabled."
msgid ""
"The map center will be moved to contacts who change their location when this "
"setting is enabled."
msgstr ""
"O centro do mapa será desprazado a un contacto que teña mudado de "
"localización se sinala esta opción."

#. i18n: file: displayConfig.ui:123
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, marbleRecenterOnLocationChange)
#: rc.cpp:57
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The map center will be moved to a contact that has changed its location "
#| "when this setting is enabled. If, for example, you are adding a new "
#| "contact to be displayed, and the location of that contact is known, the "
#| "map will show that new contact with this setting enabled. When disabled, "
#| "the map will not move on its own, but stay at the point you moved it last."
msgid ""
"The map center will be moved to contacts who change their location when this "
"setting is enabled. If, for example, you are adding a new contact to be "
"displayed, and the location of that contact is known, the map will show that "
"new contact with this setting enabled. When disabled, the map will not move "
"on its own, but stay at the point you moved it to last."
msgstr ""
"O centro do mapa será desprazado a un contacto que teña modificado a "
"localización se sinala esta opción. Por exemplo, se está a facer visíbeis "
"máis contactos, e coñece a localización do contacto, o mapa mostrará ese "
"novo contacto se escollese esta opción. Se non a sinalase, o mapa non se "
"moverá por si, senón que ficará no lugar a onde o movese por última vez."

